@startuml
title Runtime Architecture Overview

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor User

package "Runtime Core" {
  component "Orchestrator" as Orchestrator
  component "Transition Policy" as TransitionPolicy
  component "Step Executor" as StepExecutor
  component "Run Repository" as RunRepository

  package "Step Modules" {
    component "Retrieval Steps" as RetrievalSteps
    component "Card Hydration" as CardHydration
    component "Generation And Update Steps" as GenerationSteps
  }

  package "API Clients" {
    component "Qdrant Clients" as QdrantClients
    component "Postgres Clients" as PostgresClients
    component "Model Clients" as ModelClients
  }
}

package "External Systems" {
  database "Qdrant" as Qdrant
  database "Postgres" as Postgres
  component "Model Provider" as ModelProvider
}

User --> Orchestrator : user input

Orchestrator --> TransitionPolicy : ask next step
TransitionPolicy --> Orchestrator : next step / wait for user /\nfinish w error / finish w success

Orchestrator --> StepExecutor : execute selected step
StepExecutor --> RetrievalSteps : dispatch retrieval step
StepExecutor --> CardHydration : dispatch hydration step
StepExecutor --> GenerationSteps : dispatch generation step

RetrievalSteps --> QdrantClients
CardHydration --> PostgresClients
GenerationSteps --> ModelClients

QdrantClients --> Qdrant : search cards / incident chunks /\ntheory collections
PostgresClients --> Postgres : load cards / store run state
ModelClients --> ModelProvider : structuring / observation /\ngeneration calls

StepExecutor --> RunRepository : persist step result
Orchestrator --> RunRepository : load / save run state
RunRepository --> PostgresClients : persist run state

RunRepository --> Orchestrator : current run state
StepExecutor --> Orchestrator : step outcome

note bottom of TransitionPolicy
Determines which step can run next
for the current iteration.
end note

note bottom of RunRepository
Each executed step is recorded
in durable run state.
end note

note bottom of RetrievalSteps
Some modules read different
Qdrant collections depending
on the selected step.
end note

@enduml
